      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793726825895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Availability >> consistency for photos and videos\n2. Feed response time << 500ms\n3. Photo and videos should render with minimal latency\n4. Scalable upto 500M DAU with 100M posts\n\nOut of scope:\n1. Authorization and authentication\n2. GDPR compliance and other countries rule compliance\n3. Analytics about users and posts    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Availability >> consistency for photos and videos\n2. Feed response time << 500ms\n3. Photo and videos should render with minimal latency\n4. Scalable upto 500M DAU with 100M posts\n\nOut of scope:\n1. Authorization and authentication\n2. GDPR compliance and other countries rule compliance\n3. Analytics about users and posts    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
